  "releaseNotes": "0.6.0: entity mapping sources. IEntityMappingSource maps classes that cannot carry Durable attributes (generated code, shared models, other attribute systems) by returning Durable attribute objects; register with DurableMapping.Register<T>(source), DurableMapping.Register(Type, source) or DurableMapping.MappingSource; DurableMapping.AttributeSource and GetMappingSource; EntityMetadata.MappingSource. A built type's mapping cannot change afterwards. No breaking changes. See CHANGELOG.md.",
